{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"本质满函子"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"本质满函子"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于范畴之间的函子, 若其在"},{"Local":{"url":"对象的生象","text":"对象的生象"}},{"Plain":"上诱导"},{"Local":{"url":"满射(范畴论)","text":"满射"}},{"Plain":" (对于生象这等同于在 $\\pi_0$ 上为满射; 另见"},{"Local":{"url":"意象中的满射","text":"意象中的满射"}},{"Plain":"), 则称之为<strong>本质满函子</strong> (essentially surjective functor).</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>预层的下降</h3>\n<p>设 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 为本质满函子, 则"},{"Local":{"url":"预层","text":"预层"}},{"Plain":"的拉回\n$$\r\nF^*\\colon \\widehat {\\mathcal D} \\to \\widehat {\\mathcal C}\r\n$$\n为"},{"Local":{"url":"单子性函子","text":"单子性函子"}},{"Plain":"; $\\widehat {\\mathcal C}$ 上的单子 $F^*F_!$ 的代数等同于 $\\widehat {\\mathcal D}$ 的对象. (其中 $F_!$ 是 $F^*$ 的左伴随, 见"},{"Local":{"url":"预层范畴之间的伴随","text":"预层范畴之间的伴随"}},{"Plain":".)</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>.</p>\n<p>$$\r\nF^*F_! X (c) = \\operatorname{colim}_{F(c')\\to F(c)} X(c')\r\n$$</p>\n<p>考虑比较函子\n$$\r\nK\\colon \\widehat {\\mathcal D} \\to \\mathsf{Alg}(F^*F_!),\r\n\\ X\\mapsto F^*X.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}